            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What’s new in Lunchbox 1.4</h2>
<p>Sort My Windows now sorts by how you work, and setup can sort your windows for you. ⌘⇧← and → take a window past its neighbor in one press instead of stacking it, a lone window fills a laptop's screen, windows stay put when you close the lid, 1Password and other menu bar apps tile, and an orange dot on the menu bar icon says when an update is out.</p>
]]></description>
