        <item>
            <title>1.3</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:23:40 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>233</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What’s new in Lunchbox 1.3</h2>
<p>Sort My Windows: Lunchbox can sort a messy desktop into Workspaces by kind (your work, the web, chat and music), using only as many as it takes, and shows you where everything went. Find it in Lunchbox's menu; Undo puts everything back. New copies offer it at the end of setup, along with Start Fresh, which closes every window as if you clicked its red button, so apps still ask before closing anything unsaved.</p>
]]></description>
